WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.100
This is the Crew Deck — the free community deck of Street Sharkz Professional. The wire and the screen stay dark until you're on the roll.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:21.488
Joining takes one form: your name, your crew alias, your industry, and the goal you're sailing toward. Verify your email, and you're crew.

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:34.956
Already crew? Tap Already crew, and we'll email you a fresh six-digit code. Enter it, and the deck opens. Never share that code — it is your key, and yours alone.

00:00:34.956 --> 00:00:44.728
Inside: the Crew Wire — wellness, mind, and the craft of the work, three to one over business — rolling all day, free.

00:00:44.728 --> 00:00:54.980
The big screen plays right here on the deck — the deck's own channel, and the Captain's clips, rolling on the half hour.

00:00:54.980 --> 00:01:13.680
And the daily work: five pillars, every day — hydration, nutrition, fitness, mind, economics. One honest rep per pillar, logged. That is the whole secret, and it compounds.

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:25.468
Your buttons sit at the top of the deck: Open the App — crew gets the free Pup Deck, water and five quiet minutes — and founders see their Back Door right beside it.

00:01:25.468 --> 00:01:36.728
Do the daily work. Take the free Assessment if you haven't — it's how the app knows your waters. Start free. Stay Sharked Up — and touch deck.

